-- --opens specification (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6) for FibreH3
-- (doc/fibre-h3.pdf): one entry per declaration.  Generated from --opened
-- (28 Oct 2026) and checked entry by entry against the steps of the note.
-- Kinds as in truncation.opens, cup.opens and h4.opens; in addition:
--   by-definition steps of the text: const-emb (happly (ap c refl) is
--     \ t -> refl: Prelude.ap, happly; isTrunc applied to points);
--     cancel-v, res, pi-mere (trans p refl is p: Prelude.trans); tg (ap G refl
--     is refl, a written refl step: Prelude.ap); res-def, res (Definition 4,
--     with the pointing F0 since kappa0 . refl is kappa0; Fib, fpt, Triple.F/f0);
--     zeta (p0 = (*, kappa0): fpt, Triple.f0); const-prop, H, Nu (Const is the
--     fibre of the constant map); d, const-base (Trans.Z, T, d); cls-eq
--     (Phi is [kappa ; KMap.K four]); g-eq, h4k (H4 is isEquiv of Phi);
--     h3-loop (KZ2Cohomology.H3); deloop, deloop-eq (cor11 is isContr Unloop);
--   conj-unconj opens Lev.eAi, eBi, conj and unconj exactly as
--     H4Bilinear.H2.conj-unconj (its case m = 1) in h4.opens;
--   climb, surj3, surj4, deloop-c: the index arithmetic of unique-loop /
--     cor11 (NatArith.plus, isConn, isTrunc, the numerals);
--   K(Z,2) as a type (KZ2 -> KK.K two -> EMSpace.K -> EMn.Kstage -> stage2 ->
--     EM2.K2 -> Deloop.Torsors.Tor) in spread, cT, d, Nu, null, cF, H-eq:
--     each binds or applies a variable x : KZ2 under conn-elim / funext;
--     the etaV mechanism of h4.opens (doc/etav-lock-diagnostic.txt), not a
--     step of the text; inferred from the pattern, not shown one by one;
--   contr-loop, base-zero, trans-cls: the carrier HC opened to Quot.Q and its
--     image, as extra (ii) of doc/pi3-s2-postnikov.pdf.
